###
### FinanKal REST API Test Suite
### Connected to gRPC Backend on localhost:50051
### ============================================================

### ============================================================
### ACCOUNT ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### Get Account Summary - Test Account 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Account Summary - Test Account 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Account Balance - Test Account 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111/balance
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Account Balance - Test Account 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/accounts/22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222/balance
Accept: application/json

###

### ============================================================
### TRANSACTION ENDPOINTS
### ============================================================

### Create Transaction - Simple Debit/Credit
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Simple transaction between two accounts",
  "entries": [
    {
      "accountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "amount": 100.00,
      "type": "DEBIT"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "amount": 100.00,
      "type": "CREDIT"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Create Transaction - Multiple Entries
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Multi-party transaction",
  "entries": [
    {
      "accountId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "amount": 50.00,
      "type": "DEBIT"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "amount": 30.00,
      "type": "CREDIT"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
      "amount": 20.00,
      "type": "CREDIT"
    }
  ]
}

###

### Create Transaction - Large Amount
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Large transaction",
  "entries": [
    {
      "accountId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
      "amount": 1000.50,
      "type": "DEBIT"
    },
    {
      "accountId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333",
      "amount": 1000.50,
      "type": "CREDIT"
    }
  ]
}

###

